[2026-10-02T21:20:37.011Z]                         openstack subnet create public_subnet                             --allocation-pool start=192.168.1.2,end=192.168.1.100                             --network public                             --subnet-range 192.168.1.0/24
[2026-10-02T21:20:37.011Z] 
